{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/products/g65tdl",
      "destination": "/products/g63tdl",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/products/nif-techo-fl-30-copy",
      "destination": "/products/vp49tl",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/products/proclo-n382-copy",
      "destination": "/products/proclo-m382",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/products/proclo-21",
      "destination": "/products/proclo-m592",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/products/proclo-11",
      "destination": "/products/proclo-n382",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/products/selkrik-rex",
      "destination": "/products/selkirk-rex",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/products/doxle-gold-copy",
      "destination": "/products/doxle",
      "permanent": true
    }
  ],
  "rewrites": [
    {
      "source": "/((?!assets/).*)",
      "destination": "/index.html"
    }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "comment": "Hashed build output is content-addressed: the filename changes whenever the bytes change, so it is safe to cache forever. This is what the hash is for. Was previously inheriting the document policy (max-age=0, must-revalidate), which made every repeat visit re-validate the 985 kB catalogue bundle.",
      "source": "/assets/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "Static public/ assets keep their stable filenames across builds, so they get a long cache but NOT immutable - a logo or favicon replacement must be able to take effect. One day is a deliberate compromise: long enough to save the repeat fetch, short enough that a swap lands without a cache-bust query.",
      "source": "/(.*).(png|jpg|jpeg|webp|svg|ico|woff|woff2)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "The document itself must never be cached: it is the only file whose name is stable while its contents (the asset hashes) change on every deploy. Caching it would pin a visitor to a build whose chunks no longer exist.",
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
          "value": "nosniff"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-Frame-Options",
          "value": "SAMEORIGIN"
        },
        {
          "key": "Referrer-Policy",
          "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        },
        {
          "key": "Permissions-Policy",
          "value": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()"
        },
        {
          "key": "Strict-Transport-Security",
          "value": "max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload"
        },
        {
          "key": "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy",
          "value": "same-origin"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
